<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tower said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tower said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns upgraded Tower Semiconductor Ltd to attractive from neutral, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 3/4 to 12-1/4 in U.S. trading.</p>
</text>
